WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.270
Did you just say we're 
continuing the experiment?!

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.550
You saw Kanade-chan's 
expression, didn't you?

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.220
I won't involve her any further!

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.770
If there is an issue, 
Kanade herself should say so.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.230
It's not something you can decide.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.600
How can you lack delicacy to this extent?

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.250
There are some things which can't be said!

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.330
She isn't a dense idiot like 
you are, Yukimura-kun!

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:21.740
What did you just say?

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.520
If you don't take action, 
solving problems is impossible!

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.000
I'm saying that the action 
you're taking is wrong.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.010
It's that part of you which 
makes you so very...

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.000
Himuro.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.510
Today's allotment. Hurry up.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:03.270
Since it seems... I am insensitive,

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.050
if that's the way you feel, 
then I'll leave it to you.

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:08.480
Yes. All right.

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.290
I'll try talking to Kanade-chan.

