00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:04.400
<i>She's so beautiful and brilliant.</i>

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.050
<i>She seems impeccably flawless.</i>

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:11.500
<i>So why, when it comes to romance or 
love, does she suddenly turn useless?</i>

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:15.460
<i>Though, I suppose that 
isn't something I can say.</i>

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.680
My, what a coincidence, Ena!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.970
After this, would you like to have tea or...

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.740
Please say something!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:39.480
So why did you come here?

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.020
I'm out of material, 
so I came to collect data.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.600
And I wanted you to listen 
to all my complaints, Ena!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.600
I wish you'd go away.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:49.160
Yes. I was with classmates from high school.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.160
We hadn't gathered together for a while.

